      "id": "claim_7e30e8cad2e74b97801ddb3e6084b3b2",
      "statement": "The workshop-backend fetch handler serves the entire PublicApi RPC root at /api over Cap'n Web (WebSocket or HTTP batch), implements session abort by closing the WebSocket via an abortSignal extension, and allows cross-origin HTTP batch because the in-band-authorized API is already cross-origin over WebSocket.",
      "evidence": [
        {
